<title>POLAND: Optimus July net rises to PLN 1.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Optimus July net rises to PLN 1.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.99 vs   0.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.80 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.11 vs   0.55</p>
<p> Sales		   27.51 vs  28.07</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.21 vs   6.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	24.98 vs  10.60</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.68 vs  10.63</p>
<p> Sales		  230.75 vs 216.11</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer maker is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
